            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioner (Paul D. Boas), according to Petitioner (Paul D. Boas), the petitioner argues that statutory interpretation should consider the entire statute rather than focusing on just two words."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Respondent",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "ec48348a8e1766903832cdf6a61bc00ac0680d626b1637c6090d649b1b7b9c5c",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-ec48348a8e17-0001-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 21,
              "start": 21
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The respondent contends that the phrase \u201cany court\u201d should be read narrowly to include only state or United States courts, applying the rule of lenity."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Government",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "ec48348a8e1766903832cdf6a61bc00ac0680d626b1637c6090d649b1b7b9c5c",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-ec48348a8e17-0001-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 26,
              "start": 26
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Government, foreign convictions are not used as elements of crimes in the United States."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Ms. Millett",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "ec48348a8e1766903832cdf6a61bc00ac0680d626b1637c6090d649b1b7b9c5c",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-ec48348a8e17-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 36,
              "start": 36
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Ms. Millett, ms. Millett explains that the statute bars receipt of firearms by anyone under indictment, even without an appeal, and that the 922(g)(1) prohibition applies unless the conviction is overturned."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Ms. Millett",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "ec48348a8e1766903832cdf6a61bc00ac0680d626b1637c6090d649b1b7b9c5c",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-ec48348a8e17-0002-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 45,
              "start": 45
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Ms. Millett, ms. Millett describes the statute as a \u201csweeping prophylaxis\u201d against firearm misuse."
      }
    ],
