              "pages": {
                "end": 36,
                "start": 36
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Ms. Millett, the statute bars receipt of firearms by anyone under indictment, regardless of appeal, and that the 922(g)(1) prohibition remains unless the conviction is overturned."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Ms. Millett",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "ec48348a8e1766903832cdf6a61bc00ac0680d626b1637c6090d649b1b7b9c5c",
