              "pages": {
                "end": 45,
                "start": 45
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Ms. Millett, ms. Millett describes the statute as a sweeping prophylaxis against firearm misuse."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "MS. MILLETT",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "ec48348a8e1766903832cdf6a61bc00ac0680d626b1637c6090d649b1b7b9c5c",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-ec48348a8e17-0003-0001"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 53,
                "start": 53
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "Ms. Millett argues that Congress stopped funding an administrative mechanism in 1992, but the statute\u2019s meaning remains unchanged."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "MS. MILLETT",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "ec48348a8e1766903832cdf6a61bc00ac0680d626b1637c6090d649b1b7b9c5c",
              "evidence_ids": [
