              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 54,
                "start": 54
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to MS. MILLETT, ms. Millett states that public\u2011safety concerns motivated Congress\u2019s actions."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "MS. MILLETT",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "ec48348a8e1766903832cdf6a61bc00ac0680d626b1637c6090d649b1b7b9c5c",
